  "stories": [
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Profile",
        "zh": "客观履历",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "This nomadic warrior from Higashi joined Rhodes Island by sheer chance.\nWhat she lacks in strategic acumen, she makes up with a mean giant sickle swing.",
        "zh": "东国出身的流浪武者，机缘巧合之下加入罗德岛。\n不善谋略，但凭借勇猛的气势与手中那把巨大的薙刀，在战场上如入无人之境。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "DIRECT"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Clinical Analysis",
        "zh": "临床诊断分析",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Imaging tests on this Operator show clear outlines of internal organs, with no abnormal dark spots or shadows. No unusual traces of Originium particles present in the circulatory system, no signs of infection, confirming this operator as uninfected. \n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 0% \nOperator Matoimaru showed no symptoms of Oripathy. \n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] 0.12u/L \nOperator Matoimaru rarely comes into contact with Originium.",
        "zh": "造影检测结果显示，该干员体内脏器轮廓清晰，未见异常阴影，循环系统内源石颗粒检测未见异常，无矿石病感染迹象，现阶段可确认为非矿石病感染者。\n\n【体细胞与源石融合率】0%\n干员缠丸没有被源石感染的迹象。\n\n【血液源石结晶密度】0.12u/L\n干员缠丸甚少接触源石。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "25"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 1",
        "zh": "档案资料一",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Matoimaru is a magnificent warrior from Higashi.\nShe is simpleminded and prone to deception. She does catch on, but a new trick will fool her again.\nHer hobbies, at which she excels, are sparring, soccer, and floral arrangement. She has been known to organize events around these subjects, though her idea of organization is typically dragging people kicking and screaming into it.",
        "zh": "大大咧咧的东国武者。\n心思单纯，容易被骗。虽然第一次上当后就会产生警惕，但只要换一个她没见过的手法，还是会上当。\n爱好有比武、踢球、插花，在每一样上都颇有造诣，还经常会主动组织相应活动——当然，她的组织，一般就是硬拉。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "50"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 2",
        "zh": "档案资料二",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "The Oni are still a mystery to most people. Aside from living in Higashi, there seems to be little in common among the race. \nHowever, Matoimaru is yet even more different from other Oni: Her bloodlust makes her performance on the battlefield strikingly unique, though it seems she's not aware of this fact.",
        "zh": "迄今为止，鬼族对大部分人来说依然是个谜团，除了只生活于东国之外，还没有人发现他们之间有什么明显的共通之处。\n不过，很显然，缠丸小姐也确实有一些异于常人的地方：她在战场上的嗜血，和她平日所表现的性格截然不同，而她似乎对此并没有自觉。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "100"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 3",
        "zh": "档案资料三",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many Operators think Matoimaru is crude and unrefined, but they are mistaken.\nThey just need to check out her floral arrangements, on display every Saturday at 3pm. \nThe beauty she can create is positively astonishing.",
        "zh": "不少干员对缠丸小姐有一些误解，以为她只有平日那粗神经的一面，事实上这个认知是错误的。\n有这种想法的人，都应该在每周六的下午三点，去参观一下缠丸小姐的插花教室。\n在那里，他们一定会为缠丸小姐的美而惊叹的。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "150"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 4",
        "zh": "档案资料四",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Matoimaru is obviously self-conscious about her flaws: She is not good at controlling her strength or at critical thinking. \nShe took up floral arrangement to refine herself and to show the others they don't need to fear her. \nDespite this, she's remains quite gullible. At least she has learned to question the idea that she must be a great thinker in order to survive. \nAs far as she is concerned, her ideal companion would be someone who won't deceive or betray her, and will stay with her and guide her. How wonderful that would be...",
        "zh": "很显然，缠丸小姐对于自己的弱点有明显的自觉：不擅控制力量；不擅思考。\n为此，她选择用插花来锻炼技巧，用不去完全相信别人来保护自己。\n——当然，即使如此，她也依然容易受骗，缠丸小姐就是这么单纯的一个人。但至少，她已经学会了去怀疑，为了生存，她必须让不擅长思考的自己学会这么做。\n而正因为如此，对这样的她来说，如果有一个即使她什么都不用想，也绝对不会欺骗她、背叛她，还会陪伴她、引导她的人存在，那她……该会有多喜欢那个人呀。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "200"
    }
  ]
}
